# Copy this file to `.env` (gitignored) and adjust as needed. `clipd` loads it
# at startup via `dotenvy::dotenv()` - see crates/clipd/src/main.rs and
# crates/clip-core/src/config.rs's `AppPaths::resolve()`.
#
# Unset/absent vars fall back to the OS-standard (XDG) locations. Values below
# are commented out and show what those defaults currently resolve to on a
# typical Linux desktop - uncomment and edit to pin/override just one of them.

# CLIPDECK_CONFIG_DIR=/home/YOUR_USER/.config/clipdeck
# CLIPDECK_DATA_DIR=/home/YOUR_USER/.local/share/clipdeck
# CLIPDECK_CACHE_DIR=/home/YOUR_USER/.cache/clipdeck

# Alternative: override all three at once, as sibling subdirectories of one
# root (used by the test suite as CLIPDECK_TEST_HOME; also handy for a fully
# sandboxed local dev run without touching your real clipboard history):
# CLIPDECK_TEST_HOME=/home/YOUR_USER/.local/share/clipdeck-dev
